  "name": "OPENGL",
  "description": "A collection of C++ implementations demonstrating modern OpenGL fundamentals, including programmable shading pipelines and hardware-accelerated geometry rendering. The project focuses on Vertex Array Object (VAO) and Vertex Buffer Object (VBO) management, providing utility routines for GLSL shader compilation and robust error introspection. It integrates GLUT and GLEW for cross-platform windowing and extension loading, with specific support for macOS Core Profile contexts.",
